WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.600
Every newsletter in your mailbox, grouped by sender

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.400
Sorted by who mails you most — and what you never open

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.200
One keystroke unsubscribes. No web forms, no service in the middle

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.500
It tells you what it sent — and what it cannot promise

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.000
Keep the ones you actually read. Ignore hides the rest

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.400
Or clear out everything a sender ever sent you

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.600
And when a sender ignores your unsubscribe, Nevermore catches them
